OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of 'off-grid' homes
OL,4,Aeligible for #250 to help with heating
OL,5,Abills
OL,6,
OL,7,FUp to 20,000 homes using heating oil
OL,8,Fcould get a #250 payment from the Welsh
OL,9,Fgovernment to help with the rising cost
OL,10,Fof living.
OL,12,FThe government said #5m from a new
OL,13,F#130m package will help "off grid"
OL,14,Fhouseholds who are dependent on either
OL,15,Fheating oil or LPG and are eligible for
OL,16,Freduced council tax.
OL,18,FThe package includes the #100 household
OL,19,Fenergy payment, with this extended to
OL,20,Fthose eligible for council tax relief
OL,21,F"irrespective of band".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
