OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of 'off-grid' homes
OL,4,Aeligible for #250 to help with heating
OL,5,Abills
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt also includes #7m support for bus
OL,8,Ftravel and #8m for councils to help
OL,9,Fthose "not captured by other schemes".
